Build a complete, modern, professional web application titled:

# AI Smart Energy Monitoring & Optimization System

This is a B.Tech ECE academic project that combines IoT, Artificial Intelligence, energy monitoring, data analytics, and a web dashboard.

## 1. MAIN OBJECTIVE

Develop a smart campus energy monitoring platform that monitors electricity consumption in classrooms, laboratories, and other college facilities.

The system should analyze energy data using AI to:

* Detect abnormal energy consumption
* Identify possible electricity wastage
* Predict future energy consumption
* Estimate electricity costs
* Provide AI-powered energy-saving recommendations
* Compare energy usage between rooms/labs
* Generate daily, weekly, and monthly reports
* Provide alerts when unusual consumption is detected

The application should look like a real-world smart-campus product, not a basic student CRUD project.

